    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PIEDMOnT\nAIRLInES\nSCHEDULE EFFECTIVE APRIL 1, 1977.",
      "NEW YORK - NEWARK\nCOLUMBUS\nPIEDMONT AIRLINES\nSmith Reynolds Airport\nWinston-Salem, North Carolina 27102\nBALTIMORE\nCINCINNATI\nLOUISVILLE\nLEXINGTON-FRANKFORT-\nLONDON\nCORBIN\nBRISTOL-JOHNSON CITY-KINGSPORT\nNASHVILLE\nKNOXVILLE\nMEMPHIS\nATI ANTA\nPARKERSBURG\nMARIETTA\nWASHINGTON\n'ASHLAND-\n-HUNTINGTON\n-STAUNTON™\n\u003cCHARLESTON-\n/HARRISONBURG-\nGREENBRIER WAYNESBORO\nHOT SPRINGS\nCHARLOTTESVILL\nRICHMOND\nPRINCETON BLUEFIELD\n- ROANOKEN\nWINSTON-SALEM\nHICKORY\n→ ASHEVILL\nNEWPORT NEWS\nLYNCHBURG\n1/ HAMPTON-\nWILLIAMSBURG-YORKTOWN.\nNORFOLK\nDANVILLE\n*RALEIGH-\n•DURHAM\n- GREENSBORO 22\nROCKY MOUNT\nWILSON/\nHIGH POINT\n¿CHARLOTTE\n7 KINSTON\nGOLDSBORO\nGREENVILLE NC\nNEW BERN\nMOREHEAD CITY.\nBEAUFORT\nGREENVILLE-SPARTANBURG\n- FAYETTEVILLE\n• (FORT BRAGG)X\nJACKSONVILLE\n- CAMP LEJEUNE\nFLORENCE\n- COLUMBIA®\n- MYRTLE BEACH\n- AUGUSTA\nCHARLESTON\n202.173.335"
